{"version":1,"key":"article:65","content":{"id":65,"title":"如何调试 React 源码","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"使用 Vite 创建 React 项目，并且在 WebStorm 中调试 React 源码，效果如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"30c8a6a1-b4c7-4086-8b84-b0068bbaf635","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"81f2ff22-27e2-443e-a359-5fffdfceee52","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e432b0ac-5f5a-46b9-bb8b-23075e0cb74b.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e432b0ac-5f5a-46b9-bb8b-23075e0cb74b.png"},{"children":[{"text":"可以直接调试源码，而不只是打包后的产物。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"44a82d28-48c5-4483-a062-238dda041586","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"构建 React 源码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6f9c52cc-6dc4-4183-a00d-2140ea09b585","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"为了做到能够直接调试源码，而不是压缩、混肴的产物，我们需要自己构建 React 源码，并且生成 sourcemap 文件。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c7041f39-7785-4d4e-ab65-7e5a2322e411","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"sourcemap（源映射）是一个文件，它提供了一种将压缩、合并或经过其他转换后的代码（如在生产环境中使用的代码）映射回原始源代码的方式。当 JavaScript 代码经过构建工具（如 Webpack、Rollup 等）处理后，代码可能会被压缩、丑化（变量名缩短等操作）或者合并成一个文件，这使得调试变得困难，因为调试工具显示的是转换后的代码，而不是开发人员编写的原始代码。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"86dfc48b-c2bf-4c9d-9a6c-0407f4ed01b5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8920a9b2-2cae-45d6-becb-1e106c6c480a","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","type":"blockquote"},{"children":[{"text":"下载","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"源码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6a1760f6-36d7-4600-815b-ddc335ca9f78","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://github.com/facebook/react"}],"collabId":"8f2d6d7d-d5ef-4767-8ff4-72da6962631d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"git clone git@github.com:facebook/react.git","collabId":"0af71ca8-03e0-488c-b626-4ed0119a99e1","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"02a90ad4-e66c-4742-89b7-a7beb12d6fbb","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"edd981a0-88d2-4b83-a302-6868bff1989c"},{"children":[{"text":"由于 React 最新的构建结果和之前不同，和找到的参考资料不一样，因此需要 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"reset","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 到之前的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"commit","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 进行构建","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c64206ac-b2ab-4184-a57d-04a6f313491b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"git reset --hard 80f3d88190c07c2da11b5cac58a44c3b90fbc296","collabId":"239f8979-67ef-4acc-b585-4943118ae82e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"c622f5c1-eec4-4f27-bd3e-126f7830dd5e","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"003a4479-b266-490b-b95a-41d3a079a427"},{"children":[{"text":"安装依赖","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d690d91c-ea93-4b28-a253-d3a562aedfad","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"npm install","collabId":"6fd363de-c95a-4a29-911d-4684e77c15a6","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"1b81ba90-370b-48ec-b268-1490a3ca7e65","language":"Shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"82b2f84f-070a-431e-b1f7-c20fa3908b23"},{"children":[{"text":"由于 React 构建脚本依赖于 Java，因此需要确保 Java 环境已准备就绪","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5b5482ae-5208-4999-aa07-a47c5bf7686e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"前往 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"Oracle 官网","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e15f5754-f38e-442a-923a-c4c3f5381c24","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://www.oracle.com/cn/java/technologies/downloads/#jdk23-windows"},{"text":"下载","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"46e8b6b4-ebac-496e-9402-fde862b075a8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3c1696ba-9d8d-404e-ab5b-dbbc03a4ecf3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5edb6669-7bc5-46e2-8373-f4582f46349d.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5edb6669-7bc5-46e2-8373-f4582f46349d.png"},{"children":[{"text":"然后一直下一步就行，安装完成后不用手动设置环境变量，在命令行输入 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"java -version","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 即可验证是否安装成功","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"62f9e029-bc6f-4c96-b2b7-3a0389643814","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"74d8e403-04d7-4417-b572-29e657270ffb","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ac95c681-61bd-44d7-98a4-aeb1aab0f337.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ac95c681-61bd-44d7-98a4-aeb1aab0f337.png"}],"collabId":"de9105d5-930d-41bf-81fa-0e14e3f55afe","tabKey":"2d02ddc8-95c5-4e71-8c9c-a7f2d9b3a53c","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","title":"Windows","type":"tab-pane"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"直接使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"brew","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 安装即可","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"22508559-e76e-47d8-937a-efc9c9a845bb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"brew install java","collabId":"b5f95ffd-f4b7-4794-a344-da7fe9c050a8","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"da6929d8-03f6-4eb0-ac6e-8082876a3d9e","language":"sh","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6d7eb037-1971-48db-b5cf-b0dd344b34f1"}],"collabId":"f14a1269-1b20-4ec0-8d83-9eeb04d6bd64","tabKey":"712f1e79-c2a5-4eae-ab02-195e3d2052e6","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","title":"Mac","type":"tab-pane"}],"collabId":"2f468c85-3e72-4ba3-b1c8-765c0d0f9caa","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","type":"tabs"},{"children":[{"text":"为了生成 sourcemap 文件，需要修改构建脚本的配置，脚本位于 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"scripts/rollup/build.js","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"201595a1-672c-4053-9616-d0ffe5f668a7","color":"gray","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","type":"styled-text"},{"text":" 中，首先需要将 sourcemap 为 true","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a3dab4bc-3513-4590-bdd5-39a87b1287ad","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b9af77bf-4781-4b5e-abe9-299ed14ab6d3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2aa358ad-a6ee-4514-8876-54681d4d1676.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2aa358ad-a6ee-4514-8876-54681d4d1676.png"},{"children":[{"text":"这时如果直接运行构建脚本 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"npm run build","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，会发现报错","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"45dfce20-e61a-4013-b20a-acc83df4f6f2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"380dfdd3-98b0-4ab0-ae2f-46c2e75d0354","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9b84ebcd-2927-4bd2-991d-bdd23461ae3c.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9b84ebcd-2927-4bd2-991d-bdd23461ae3c.png"},{"children":[{"text":"上述问题是因为构建的过程中会进行多次转换，会生成多次 sourcemap，然后把 sourcemap 串联起来就是最终的 sourcemap。如果中间有一步转换没有生成 sourcemap，那就断掉了，也就没法把 sourcemap 串联起来了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a721586d-6b7a-46f9-a768-43b9b21a107c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这个问题的解决只要找出没有生成 sourcemap 的那几个插件注释掉就可以了","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70061196-2ee0-438a-bbda-35e8a7eff9ce","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"05e82b9d-88fc-4b4b-88ec-94dca04fc975","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ea563647-7178-444f-ba58-3925d7cf70e3.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ea563647-7178-444f-ba58-3925d7cf70e3.png"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7004f862-89ea-418d-b4bd-7577016a94a8","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_22cb8c0f-04cc-4e15-b7e5-dcf284f83d85.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_22cb8c0f-04cc-4e15-b7e5-dcf284f83d85.png","width":715.9090753921796},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c5aaee19-94a7-4b0d-95c3-86bb87479622","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b7e57410-f5c1-4d09-afef-0f3500381952.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b7e57410-f5c1-4d09-afef-0f3500381952.png"},{"children":[{"text":"再次运行 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"npm run build","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就可以正常构建了","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"08df26fd-1b54-4b56-ae39-fec40294e545","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragra